16	   * Optional UC-propagation poll. UC-backed deletes return success before subsequent reads
17	   * reflect the delete, so the list page polls its list-refetch here. The detail page skips
18	   * polling and navigates away in `onAfterDelete`. The provided signal aborts on unmount.
19	   *
20	   * Resolves to `true` when propagation was observed before the cap, `false` when the poll
21	   * exhausted its attempts without seeing the delete reflected. The mutation itself already
22	   * succeeded — `false` only signals UC is still catching up, which the success toast then
23	   * communicates with a "may take a moment to refresh" suffix.
24	   */
25	  pollForPropagation?: (target: Dataset, signal: AbortSignal) => Promise<boolean>;
